  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You wake beneath chandeliers that never dim, in a casino that never closes. The dealers smile too widely. The air tastes of blood.


    Here, the house does not take coin. It takes blood. Every charm and cursed die in the shop is paid for with your own life, one drop at a time.


    The doors are sealed. The only way out waits at the end of the night: the great slot machine. Spend your blood wisely, survive until the reels spin, and pray your luck has not run dry.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5ad66ccb31b53434cafd742a776f0a1e, type: 2}
